    <bpmn:process id="W_W3605" name="W3605. DG Last-Mile &amp; 3PL DG Shipping Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Ecommerce/B2B DG last-mile shipment (links to VS-06.3/VS-56)
Frequency: Per DG last-mile shipment
Volume: DG last-mile shipments (subset of ~42.9K ecommerce orders/month + contractor deliveries)
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Last-Mile Logistics
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, Last-Mile/3PL (links to VS-06.3/VS-56), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), DC/Dark-Store (links to VS-04/VS-93), HSE (links to VS-24), DG Shipper, 3PL Carrier
Source: workflow W3605 — DG Last-Mile &amp; 3PL DG Shipping Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3605_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3605_Lane1" name="DG">
