      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3605_Start3" name="Ecommerce/B2B DG last-mile shipment (links to VS-06.3/VS-56)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3605_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3605_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Last-Mile qualify and route DG last-mile shipments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Last-Mile qualify and route DG last-mile shipments to DG-capable 3PLs/carriers (W3601): apply the DG-carrier filter to order routing (links to VS-60), verify last-mile DG documentation (W3602) and packaging/marking (W3598), and ensure the 3PL driver/crew is DG-trained (W3597) and equipped
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Last-Mile
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain / VP Legal
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3605_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3605_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3605_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/3PL execute DG last-mile delivery: vehicle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/3PL execute DG last-mile delivery: vehicle placarding, route compliance (hazmat route restrictions), secure handoff to customer (age/identity verification for restricted items, safe-handling briefing for chemicals), and POD with DG documentation return; manage delivery exceptions and refusals
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / 3PL / Last-Mile
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3605_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3605_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3605_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Last-Mile manage 3PL DG performance (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Last-Mile manage 3PL DG performance (links to VS-56.2/VS-67), audit DG last-mile compliance, manage the limited courier pool for DG (the model-company reality that hazmat shipping options are limited), and report to governance (W3608)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Last-Mile
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain / VP Legal
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3605_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3605_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3605_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3605_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
