    <bpmn:process id="W_W3606" name="W3606. DG Transport Incident, Spill &amp; Emergency Response" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DG transport incident (spill, leak, fire, accident, exposure)
Frequency: Rare but high-impact
Volume: DG transport incidents
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Logistics Emergency Response
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, Logistics (links to VS-06), HSE (links to VS-24/VS-26.2), Carrier, Emergency Responders, Legal (links to VS-100), Insurance (links to VS-26), Compliance (links to VS-22), Communications (links to VS-14.3)
Source: workflow W3606 — DG Transport Incident, Spill &amp; Emergency Response</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3606_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3606_Lane1" name="Carrier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3606_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3606_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3606_Lane2" name="DG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3606_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3606_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3606_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3606_Start4" name="DG transport incident (spill, leak, fire, accident, exposure)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3606_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3606_Task5" name="Carrier/Logistics respond to the DG transport incident: immediate safety…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Carrier/Logistics respond to the DG transport incident: immediate safety (isolate, evacuate, PPE), first response per the SDS (W3595) and emergency-response guide, notification to BuildRight DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer and HSE, and engagement of emergency responders (fire/BFP, medical, hazmat contractor); secure the scene and prevent spread
Responsible (R): Carrier / Logistics / DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain / VP Legal
Duration: Immediate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3606_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3606_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3606_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE manage the response and notification…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE manage the response and notification: regulatory notification (DENR-EMB for environmental release, DOLE for worker, MARINA/Coast Guard/CAB/LTFRB for transport, LGU), carrier/3PL coordination, containment/clean-up/remediation (hazmat contractor), and customer/public communication (links to VS-14.3); engage legal (links to VS-100) and insurance (links to VS-26)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE / Legal / Insurance
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Incident life</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3606_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3606_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3606_Task7" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE conduct incident investigation and root-cause…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE conduct incident investigation and root-cause (links to VS-24/VS-21), document the incident (W3613/W3600), manage claims/insurance recovery (links to VS-26/VS-90), and feed corrective action to classification/packaging/training/carrier (W3594/W3598/W3597/W3601); report to governance (W3616) and risk (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE / Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Post-incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3606_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3606_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3606_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3606_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3606_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-572 (ensure controlled execution — DG Transport, Carrier &amp; Ecommerce Shipping Compliance (PA-114.2).) | - operational: 24/7 notification and emergency-response plan; operational: notification protocol and timeline
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Logistics Emergency Response</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
