    <bpmn:process id="W_W3607" name="W3607. DG Transport Permit, Escort &amp; Port / Airport Handling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DG import/export (links to VS-87); DG through port/airport; special-permit DG
Frequency: Per DG port/airport movement + permit cycle
Volume: DG import/export and inter-island port/airport movements
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Import
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, Import (links to VS-02.2/VS-87), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), Broker, Carrier, Port/Airport Authority, HSE (links to VS-24)
Source: workflow W3607 — DG Transport Permit, Escort &amp; Port / Airport Handling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3607_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3607_Lane1" name="DG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3607_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3607_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3607_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3607_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3607_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3607_Start3" name="DG import/export (links to VS-87); DG through port/airport; special-permit DG">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3607_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3607_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Import manage DG port/airport handling: pre-advise…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Import manage DG port/airport handling: pre-advise the port/airport authority and terminal of DG cargo, secure DG berth/slot/stowage, arrange DG handling/escort (some DG requires escort/special handling), and align to terminal DG rules and cut-offs; coordinate with broker (links to VS-02.2)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Import / Broker
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain / VP Legal
Duration: Per movement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3607_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3607_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3607_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Import secure special DG permits where required…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Import secure special DG permits where required: special-permit DG (high-hazard), DENR import permit for regulated chemicals (links to W3599), MARINA/Coast Guard/CAB transport permits, and escort/police coordination for high-risk DG; manage the permit lifecycle and validity
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Import / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per permit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3607_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
