      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3607_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Logistics manage DG port/airport documentation and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Logistics manage DG port/airport documentation and handoff (links to W3602), monitor dwell-time/demurrage for DG (links to VS-02.2/W249), and resolve DG-specific port/airport issues; report DG port/airport performance to governance (W3608)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Logistics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
