    <bpmn:process id="W_W3608" name="W3608. DG Transport Audit, Carrier Performance &amp; Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; governance cycle
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: DG transport program
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Logistics
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), BI (links to VS-28.1), Audit (links to VS-21), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), HSE (links to VS-24), ExCo (links to VS-33.2)
Source: workflow W3608 — DG Transport Audit, Carrier Performance &amp; Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
